(5. PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Step 1: Record the batch number in the logbook.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Verify the result in accordance with the acceptance criterion.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Send the completed record to Quality by e-mail.) Tj T*
(Step 4: The operator must be trained on this procedure before starting.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Ensure that the second-person check is signed.) Tj T*
(Step 6: Confirm the equipment status label shows clean and in date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
